@CoreInventory_HostAddress = http://localhost:5193

### Health check (expects "pong")
GET {{CoreInventory_HostAddress}}/api/status/ping
Accept: text/plain

### List all products
GET {{CoreInventory_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Get a single product by id
GET {{CoreInventory_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a product
POST {{CoreInventory_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Product",
  "description": "Created from the .http file",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "Test"
}

### Update a product
PUT {{CoreInventory_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "description": "Updated from the .http file",
  "price": 24.99,
  "stock": 5,
  "category": "Test"
}

### Delete a product
DELETE {{CoreInventory_HostAddress}}/api/products/1

###
